<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss Michelin 1996 net up 12.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Swiss Michelin 1996 net up 12.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRIBOURG, Switzerland 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Consolidated net profit    745		 vs 662</p>
<p> Minority interests	   123		 vs 85</p>
<p> Group net			622		 vs 577</p>
<p> Net sales			17,311	    vs 15,651</p>
<p> Trading profit		 1,622	     vs 1,272</p>
<p> Net financial charges	384		 vs 401</p>
<p> Ordinary profit		1,238	     vs 871</p>
<p> Exceptional		    162 loss	  vs 32 profit</p>
<p> Depreciation of goodwill   41		  vs 32</p>
<p> Tax on profit		  289		 vs 209</p>
<p> Cash flow			1,966	     vs 962</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Compagnie Financiere Michelin (CFM), the Swiss holding company for France's Compagnie Generale des Etablissements Michelin. The French group reported 1996 results on March 18 including net profit of 3.11 billion French francs before minorities. -- Zurich Newsroom, 41-1-631 7340</p>
